## Changes

- **`backend/handlers/midi_test.go`**: Raise the length guard from `< 14` to `< 18` so `t.Fatalf` fires before any slice access; update the function comment to match.

```go
// Before
if len(midi) < 14 {
    t.Fatalf("MIDI too short: %d bytes", len(midi))
}
// ...
if string(midi[14:18]) != "MTrk" { // panics if 14 ≤ len < 18

// After
if len(midi) < 18 {
    t.Fatalf("MIDI too short: %d bytes", len(midi))
}
// ...
if string(midi[14:18]) != "MTrk" { // safe
```

